            0.11,
            0.883,
            0.168
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When doctors take an MRI scan of some part of your body, it is like taking a cross-section because it allows them to look at the inside of your body in slices."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.168,
            0.719,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What is the area of the curved surface of a cylinder?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.187,
            0.882,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let the radius of the circular base of the cylinder be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "r ;"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " let its height be h. Suppose the cylinder is cut as shown in the figure below. We get a rectangle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.189,
